/* The dock bar: full width, docked to the bottom edge - this desktop has
   no shell, so this is the taskbar. Colours are opaque on purpose: on
   non-default desktops DWM does not composite, so a translucent bar
   background renders invisible - do not switch it to rgba(). */
QWidget {
    background: #F3F3F3;
    border-top: 1px solid #E5E5E5;
}

/* Buttons are invisible until hovered: the icon sits straight on the bar
   and only the hover pill is drawn behind it. No size rules here - the
   button box is set in composeDock and belongs with the layout code. */
QToolButton {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

QToolButton:hover {
    background: #E8E8E8;
}

QToolButton:pressed {
    background: #DADADA;
}
